do_1 = "Replace eager primary RPC selection at apps/launchpad/web/src/core/rpc.ts:54 with deferred resolution and migrate its imports and re-export in apps/launchpad/web/src/core/wagmi-config.ts:4, deferring RPC-dependent chain, transport and embedded-wallet initialization at wagmi-config.ts:13, wagmi-config.ts:37, wagmi-config.ts:47 and wagmi-config.ts:65 until a validated configuration is consumed; also defer the shared resolver call at apps/launchpad/web/src/core/wallet-sdk/client.ts:11 so importing the layout's wallet dependencies cannot bypass configuration diagnostics."
do_2 = "Add a declared async test function rpcColdImportReportsInvalidOverrides in apps/launchpad/web/src/core/rpc-configuration.test.tsx and register it with test(rpcColdImportReportsInvalidOverrides); for each RPC override and invalid value, including empty, malformed and path-bearing URLs, set the environment before clearing the module cache and importing the real RPC, backend-origin, wagmi and wallet-client modules, assert imports succeed, assert backendConfigurationProblems returns the matching BackendOriginError and origins are null, and render the real BackendConfigurationError with those problems to assert its alert state without initializing transports or contacting an endpoint."
do_3 = "Add and register a declared async test function rpcColdImportPreservesValidatedSelection in the same test file to prove unset overrides retain the existing default, valid overrides retain precedence and deduplication across the resolver and both wallet chain definitions, and explicit invalid resolver or transport use still raises RpcConfigurationError without selecting a fallback; preserve the rejection rules at apps/launchpad/web/src/core/rpc.ts:16 and the diagnostic conversion at apps/launchpad/web/src/core/backend-origins.ts:157, leaving the distinct request-time CSP defect described by issue #1689 to its own repair."
